WEBVTT

00:01.668 --> 00:04.304
I'm Nina, 12 years old.

00:04.304 --> 00:08.008
I was just an ordinary
junior high school student, but...

00:08.008 --> 00:11.177
Since the day I accidentally swallowed
a ball called the Crystal Pearl,

00:11.177 --> 00:14.047
my life has changed pretty drastically.

00:14.047 --> 00:17.717
And the ball happened to be something
that's used for the sorcery test.

00:17.717 --> 00:19.552
The team of the two examinees,
which happens to possess that ball

00:19.552 --> 00:24.683
when the test ends, will pass the test
and become professional sorcerers!

00:27.360 --> 00:29.529
Does that mean I'm going to be
chased down by the examinees?

00:29.529 --> 00:32.365
- Don't cry!
- I guess you have no choice
but to prepare yourself, Zero.

00:32.365 --> 00:33.366
Huh?

00:33.366 --> 00:35.235
There is only one way to do this.

00:35.235 --> 00:37.971
You will have to protect her
with everything you've got

00:37.971 --> 00:39.372
until the day that the test ends.

00:39.372 --> 00:40.707
Until the day the medicine is completed

00:40.707 --> 00:44.344
and you're able to remove
the Crystal Pearl from her body...

00:44.344 --> 00:46.279
We will protect her with our own hands!

00:46.279 --> 00:47.380
You mean her?

00:47.380 --> 00:51.718
Me? These guys are going to protect me?

00:51.718 --> 00:54.354
Just like the princes
who bravely face the enemies

00:54.354 --> 00:56.189
no matter how ferocious they are

00:56.189 --> 00:58.324
and fight them for the people
that they love and their own dreams...

00:58.324 --> 01:01.061
These two are going to protect me!

01:01.061 --> 01:13.640
One love! Two love? Three love! Four love?
One love! Two love? Three love! Come on!

01:13.640 --> 01:19.913
Here's what boys don't know.
Girls are moody.

01:19.913 --> 01:26.152
You're a sweet person
and it will be okay tomorrow.

01:26.152 --> 01:32.425
But I feel different today.
I want to go all out!

01:32.425 --> 01:38.731
Because I can't decide it just yet
I want everything

01:38.731 --> 01:45.038
The kinds of love are just like jewels.

01:45.038 --> 01:51.344
Each of them (Shining boys!)
is sparkling. Yes!

01:51.344 --> 01:57.550
They say there is only one true love

01:57.550 --> 02:03.823
But it's okay, we can decide
that at the very last moment

02:03.823 --> 02:10.063
That moment (Happiness)
I will protect it (Happiness)

02:10.063 --> 02:16.369
Come on, let's go find a popping heart

02:16.369 --> 02:22.675
My love! True love! Your love! Pure love!
My love! True love! Your love! Pure love!

02:22.675 --> 02:27.408
My love! True love! Your love!
Pure love! My love! True love!

02:33.653 --> 02:36.289
Zero! I was going to get that cake!

02:36.289 --> 02:38.691
Shut up! First come, first served!

02:38.691 --> 02:40.326
You're the one who cut in front of me!

02:40.326 --> 02:42.428
I'm sure they'll bring some more out
if you wait a little bit!

02:42.428 --> 02:44.464
That was the last one!!

02:44.464 --> 02:47.767
Zero, Nina-chan,
stop fighting all the time!

02:47.767 --> 02:49.701
You're disturbing other customers.

02:51.271 --> 02:53.173
- But Zero was-
- But Nina was-

02:53.173 --> 02:54.765
Why you!!

02:57.343 --> 03:00.180
That was delicious!
I'll have another one!

03:00.180 --> 03:02.478
Hey, knock it off, you two!

03:03.082 --> 03:05.618
Zura!!

03:05.618 --> 03:08.655
All of you! Pay the damage!

03:08.655 --> 03:10.557
- Yes, sir...
- Yes, sir...
- Yes, sir...

03:10.557 --> 03:11.891
Hmm...

03:11.891 --> 03:13.426
Looks like they're having fun.

03:13.426 --> 03:17.230
They have no sense of urgency even though
they're in the middle of the sorcery test.

03:17.230 --> 03:19.199
They're being a little
nonchalant, don't you think?

03:19.199 --> 03:22.068
It's time for them to stop
getting too relaxed anyway.

03:22.068 --> 03:24.103
But whether they like it or not

03:24.103 --> 03:25.972
their tension will definitely
rise if we go there.

03:25.972 --> 03:28.641
Well, shall we go now, Aquamarine?

03:28.641 --> 03:30.243
Sure.

03:30.243 --> 03:31.938
To the human world!

03:33.880 --> 03:36.110
To the world of the examinees!

03:41.621 --> 03:47.082
"The Mid-Term Test is a Disaster!"

03:48.228 --> 03:51.631
All my savings is gone!
It's Zero's fault!

03:51.631 --> 03:53.166
I didn't do anything wrong!

03:53.166 --> 03:56.102
Zero! You were wrong, too!
You need to reflect on what you did!

03:56.102 --> 03:58.371
Hehee! You got scolded!

03:58.371 --> 03:59.572
You, too, Nina-chan!

03:59.572 --> 04:01.007
What?

04:01.007 --> 04:03.643
Bummer... Why did it
have to be like that...

04:03.643 --> 04:07.044
I just wanted to chat
with them over cakes...

04:15.655 --> 04:17.316
Nina-chan, are you all right?

04:23.863 --> 04:26.499
San! Forte!

04:26.499 --> 04:31.104
I'm so happy to run into you
at a place like this, Ichii-sama!

04:31.104 --> 04:33.640
All of you, are you after Nina again?

04:33.640 --> 04:37.777
No, we're not! Some weirdo showed up
out of the blue and he used magic then...

04:37.777 --> 04:38.745
Magic, you said?

04:38.745 --> 04:42.237
Excuse me, but that was insulting
for you to call me a weirdo.

04:46.286 --> 04:50.222
My name is Will,
a professional sorcerer.

04:51.324 --> 04:52.759
And...

04:52.759 --> 04:56.362
I am an inspector from
the sorcery test headquarters.

04:56.362 --> 04:59.232
What is an inspector
from there doing here anyway?

04:59.232 --> 05:00.133
That's right!

05:00.133 --> 05:03.569
I thought that the test would be
at the end of the year, Christmas!

05:03.569 --> 05:06.806
The reason why I've
gathered you all here

05:06.806 --> 05:10.643
is to have you take the
mid-term test starting now.

05:10.643 --> 05:12.378
- "Mid-term test"?
- "Mid-term test"?
- "Mid-term test"?

05:12.378 --> 05:15.248
Oh, by the way, you won't be eligible
to take the main test

05:15.248 --> 05:17.784
unless you pass this mid-term test,
so keep that in mind.

05:17.784 --> 05:19.619
No one told us about that!

05:19.619 --> 05:23.356
Inspector, what kind of test
is this mid-term test?

05:23.356 --> 05:26.159
Hmm? That's a good question.

05:26.159 --> 05:27.060
Nina.

05:27.060 --> 05:28.428
Huh?

05:28.428 --> 05:31.564
You must be the girl who's swallowed
the Crystal Pearl, correct?

05:31.564 --> 05:33.566
Y-Yes...

05:33.566 --> 05:36.135
I know this is sudden,
but I need your help...

05:36.135 --> 05:37.303
What?

05:37.303 --> 05:39.806
With this mid-term test!

05:39.806 --> 05:41.273
You bastard!

05:42.575 --> 05:43.439
Listen up!

05:45.611 --> 05:47.080
My fellow examiners!

05:47.080 --> 05:51.417
The objective of this mid-term test
is to retrieve Nina from me!

05:51.417 --> 05:56.022
The team that successfully retrieves Nina
from me by sunset will pass the test!

05:56.022 --> 06:00.459
And if you fail to do so, all of you
will fail the test! Good luck to you!

06:05.365 --> 06:06.666
- Nina!
- Nina-chan!

06:06.666 --> 06:08.368
- Nina!
- Nina-chan!

06:08.368 --> 06:09.369
What do we do?

06:09.369 --> 06:12.305
We will fail the test unless
we retrieve Nina, right?

06:12.305 --> 06:13.272
If that's the case...

06:13.272 --> 06:15.041
We have no choice
but to do it, do we?

06:15.041 --> 06:18.378
- We have to help, too!
- We have to help, too!
- We have to help, too!

06:18.378 --> 06:22.782
- Wait! Wait! Wait!
- Wait! Wait! Wait!
- Wait! Wait! Wait!

06:22.782 --> 06:24.272
- Nina!
- Nina-chan!

06:27.553 --> 06:30.156
This building looks like an
ordinary building from the outside,

06:30.156 --> 06:33.126
but barriers surround it,
so no one can come inside.

06:33.126 --> 06:36.462
In other words this is a locked castle.

06:36.462 --> 06:39.999
And that makes you
like a captured princess.

06:39.999 --> 06:41.401
So how are you feeling?

06:41.401 --> 06:43.436
Hey, explain what's going on!

06:43.436 --> 06:45.738
What are you doing making me dress
like this? Do you think it's funny?

06:45.738 --> 06:48.241
No, but I just figured
it'd make it more exciting

06:48.241 --> 06:51.544
if I add some props like that.
It looks great on you, Nina-chan.

06:51.544 --> 06:53.513
By the way, this is
one of the props, too.

06:53.513 --> 06:54.680
How dare you!!

06:54.680 --> 06:57.016
It's pointless to try to make noise.

06:57.016 --> 06:59.652
What? This cat is talking!

06:59.652 --> 07:01.821
I told you not to make noise!

07:01.821 --> 07:03.423
Besides do not call me "cat"!

07:03.423 --> 07:06.859
I am Aquamarine, a sorcerer's helper!

07:06.859 --> 07:10.797
What? Sorcerer's helper?
So that means you're just like Zura?

07:10.797 --> 07:14.500
Hmph! I'm a professional sorcerer's helper!

07:14.500 --> 07:17.203
Don't mix it up with
some examinee's helper, okay!

07:17.203 --> 07:23.870
Oh... Looks like they're here.
Those examinees have followed you.

07:25.011 --> 07:26.546
It's right here zura! Right here zura!

07:26.546 --> 07:29.115
I can feel Nina's presence from here!

07:29.115 --> 07:31.709
From here... From this building...

07:34.420 --> 07:37.323
Nina's presence...

07:37.323 --> 07:38.090
Damn it!

07:38.090 --> 07:39.525
Hey, Zero!

07:39.525 --> 07:42.358
Don't do it zura, Zero! Zero!

07:45.298 --> 07:48.134
You won't be able to go in because
a barrier has been formed by magic.

07:48.134 --> 07:50.102
Say stuff like that sooner!

07:50.102 --> 07:53.606
That only proves that you're
inexperienced for not realizing that.

07:53.606 --> 07:54.574
Inspector!

07:54.574 --> 07:59.779
Damn it! I don't care if you're a pro
or an inspector, just give back Nina!

07:59.779 --> 08:00.613
Zero!

08:00.613 --> 08:04.515
Don't do it zura, Zero! Zero!

08:05.751 --> 08:07.353
What you're looking at
is just a 3-D image!

08:07.353 --> 08:10.223
Like I said, say stuff like that earlier!

08:10.223 --> 08:11.781
Isn't it obvious just by looking at it?

08:12.959 --> 08:14.660
However, my fellow examinees,

08:14.660 --> 08:17.830
I will give you credit
for finding this place at least.

08:17.830 --> 08:19.632
Just like you've figured,

08:19.632 --> 08:22.969
Nina and I are on the
top floor of this building.

08:22.969 --> 08:26.706
But in order to reach the top floor,
you must get past the various traps

08:26.706 --> 08:30.643
that have been set up in this building,
so be careful.

08:30.643 --> 08:34.602
I'll be looking forward
to seeing you all succeed!

08:39.452 --> 08:40.553
Damn!

08:40.553 --> 08:41.521
But before that...

08:41.521 --> 08:44.590
We have to break
this barrier first zura!

08:44.590 --> 08:48.594
Zura, Zura, stay back!
Let me handle this.

08:48.594 --> 08:50.425
Defense magic, practical application!

08:51.464 --> 08:53.159
Barrier Release!

08:57.904 --> 08:59.599
- Let's go!
- Yeah!

09:01.807 --> 09:03.809
Not bad.

09:03.809 --> 09:07.446
But I wonder if they'll be able
to get past all the traps

09:07.446 --> 09:09.710
that have been set up
in this building...

09:10.950 --> 09:12.585
Hang in there, Nina!

09:12.585 --> 09:14.287
No matter how hard
the obstacles may be

09:14.287 --> 09:17.156
I promise I will come
and save you, Nina!

09:17.156 --> 09:19.091
- No matter what kind of traps await us!
- No matter what kind of traps await us!

09:19.091 --> 09:21.661
Now ladies and gentlemen!

09:21.661 --> 09:24.789
The first challenge is
"exciting fast button-pushing quiz"!

09:26.232 --> 09:27.900
Hey, wait a minute!

09:27.900 --> 09:30.169
How come the sorcery test is a quiz?

09:30.169 --> 09:33.839
This is a test to determine your ability
to correspond to a crisis situation!

09:33.839 --> 09:36.576
We will check your aptitude
as a pro, so be prepared!

09:36.576 --> 09:40.444
Now here's the first question!

09:41.547 --> 09:44.083
What kind of doctor is always losing?

09:44.083 --> 09:45.518
- What?
- What?
- What?

09:45.518 --> 09:47.611
What kind of doctor is always losing?

09:48.621 --> 09:50.690
"Haisha" as in dentist!

09:50.690 --> 09:51.958
You're correct!

09:51.958 --> 09:55.528
The Gou and Rokka Team has passed!
They can now advance to the second floor!

09:55.528 --> 09:57.330
Ichii-sama, good luck to you!

09:57.330 --> 09:58.331
Shoot!

09:58.331 --> 10:00.032
They beat us to it...

10:00.032 --> 10:01.267
I've got this!

10:01.267 --> 10:03.469
Now we're moving on
to the second question!

10:03.469 --> 10:06.772
What kind of cake makes you feel like
you're going to get electrocuted by it?

10:06.772 --> 10:08.240
- What?
- What?
- What?

10:08.240 --> 10:09.537
Get electrocuted by eating it-

10:10.343 --> 10:11.444
Shortcake!

10:11.444 --> 10:14.213
Ding-ding-ding-ding!! You're correct!

10:14.213 --> 10:18.317
The Zero and Ichii Team has passed!
They can now advance to the next floor!

10:18.317 --> 10:19.785
- What?
- What?

10:19.785 --> 10:20.753
Sorry!

10:20.753 --> 10:21.854
See you later!

10:21.854 --> 10:23.489
We'll be waiting upstairs!

10:23.489 --> 10:24.924
This is not good.

10:24.924 --> 10:28.052
If we can't get the answer right
in the next round, we'll be disqualified!

10:29.395 --> 10:30.329
What the-!

10:30.329 --> 10:33.432
Fo-chan, I'm hungry! Let's eat!

10:33.432 --> 10:36.836
Can you be a little patient?
This is very important right now.

10:36.836 --> 10:38.137
What?

10:38.137 --> 10:39.900
Now let's move onto the third question!

10:41.107 --> 10:44.644
It's a pan, but this pan is not edible!
What kind of pan is it?

10:44.644 --> 10:47.880
Yes, that's the easy one!

10:47.880 --> 10:51.817
Oh, thank you, God!

10:51.817 --> 10:59.592
Because... Because the non-edible pan
has to be... it! It has to be it!

10:59.592 --> 11:02.061
Please give us your answer!
This is the question!

11:02.061 --> 11:06.032
It's a pan, but this pan is not edible!
What kind of pan is it?

11:06.032 --> 11:08.557
- Fri...
...ed chicken! I want to eat some!

11:10.569 --> 11:11.671
Wrong answer!

11:11.671 --> 11:14.306
The answer is frying pan!

11:14.306 --> 11:16.475
San just said she wants
to eat some fried chicken,

11:16.475 --> 11:18.210
but that doesn't mean
I gave you my answer!

11:18.210 --> 11:18.944
No.

11:18.944 --> 11:21.213
On joint and several responsibility,
both of you are disqualified!

11:21.213 --> 11:22.578
No way!

11:23.849 --> 11:26.686
I've got to go up...
I've got to go up!

11:26.686 --> 11:29.155
I don't care what kinds of traps
have been laid out for us!

11:29.155 --> 11:31.157
That's right! Good luck!

11:31.157 --> 11:32.351
Please!

11:33.159 --> 11:35.061
Hey, that was Rock's voice.

11:35.061 --> 11:35.761
Let's go!

11:35.761 --> 11:37.029
- We don't care what kinds of traps
- We don't care what kinds of traps

11:37.029 --> 11:38.997
- have been laid out for us!
- have been laid out for us!

11:39.732 --> 11:40.833
We've been waiting for you!

11:40.833 --> 11:42.601
Macho! Macho!

11:42.601 --> 11:43.703
This is the worst!

11:43.703 --> 11:47.339
- The second challenge is called
"Defeat the Attacking Macho Men"!
- Gross!

11:47.339 --> 11:49.575
Like I said, what does it
have to do with magic?

11:49.575 --> 11:54.103
It's all about how much power you have
no matter what it is, I guess!

11:55.081 --> 11:58.517
Transforming magic!
Be a mighty elephant!

12:00.386 --> 12:02.455
M-Mighty elephant?

12:02.455 --> 12:05.291
That's right! Mighty elephant!

12:05.291 --> 12:06.358
Huh?

12:06.358 --> 12:09.462
Mighty elephant!

12:09.462 --> 12:12.364
You see especially around here is mighty!

12:12.364 --> 12:14.066
- Shaky, shaky, shaky, shaky...
- Shaky, shaky, shaky, shaky...

12:14.066 --> 12:16.769
No, that's not it, Lady Rokka!

12:16.769 --> 12:18.327
You mean this one, right?

12:22.007 --> 12:23.975
- I want to hug it!
- I want to hug it!

12:27.747 --> 12:31.183
Oh, no, Lady Rokka! You're too weak!

12:34.987 --> 12:37.285
The Gou and Rokka Team
is now disqualified!

12:42.261 --> 12:47.299
Zero, those macho men might look ridiculous
at a glance, but they're pretty strong!

12:47.299 --> 12:48.801
Don't let your guard down!

12:48.801 --> 12:52.037
When it comes to stuff like this,
you have to let me handle it!

12:52.037 --> 12:53.305
Go get 'em!

12:53.305 --> 12:55.637
Yeah! I'm coming at ya, baby!

12:58.077 --> 12:59.271
Here I come!

13:00.913 --> 13:02.403
Destruction magic!

13:04.016 --> 13:06.211
Hitting Knuckle!

13:10.890 --> 13:13.459
All right! That felt good!

13:13.459 --> 13:15.694
Okay! You knocked them out beautifully!

13:15.694 --> 13:18.390
Now please proceed to the next floor,
Zero and Ichii!

13:19.598 --> 13:22.668
They did it! At this rate they're going
to sweep the board and pass the test!

13:22.668 --> 13:24.837
I don't know about that, Nina.

13:24.837 --> 13:25.738
What?

13:25.738 --> 13:28.070
This doesn't mean that the test is over.

13:29.742 --> 13:33.212
There's still a final challenge left.

13:33.212 --> 13:34.213
Huh?

13:34.213 --> 13:37.016
After the brain challenge
and the physical challenge,

13:37.016 --> 13:38.847
there's a final challenge!

13:41.153 --> 13:42.711
What's that?

13:45.825 --> 13:47.693
D-Dragon?

13:47.693 --> 13:50.253
Not only that, it is humongous!

13:54.333 --> 13:59.293
Do you think you can get
past this final challenge?

14:02.508 --> 14:04.243
Zero! Ichii!

14:04.243 --> 14:05.835
Damn it!

14:08.914 --> 14:10.973
We're not going to lose!

14:27.633 --> 14:29.430
Zero! Ichii!

14:30.603 --> 14:32.093
Defense magic!

14:34.740 --> 14:38.577
Boy, this year's examinees
aren't all that, are they?

14:38.577 --> 14:39.912
That's not true!

14:39.912 --> 14:42.781
Zero and Ichii are strong!

14:42.781 --> 14:44.350
But you see that, right?

14:44.350 --> 14:45.885
I know they are coming!

14:45.885 --> 14:49.622
They're going to defeat you
and rescue me for sure!

14:49.622 --> 14:51.223
I don't know about that.

14:51.223 --> 14:53.214
You guys were arguing, weren't you?

14:54.793 --> 14:57.796
Do you seriously think that
they'll risk their lives

14:57.796 --> 15:01.200
and come rescue someone that they
were having an argument with?

15:01.200 --> 15:05.227
Once they realize they're just not going
to make it, I'm sure they'll run away.

15:06.405 --> 15:11.043
B-But Zero and Ichii promised me
that they would protect me!

15:11.043 --> 15:13.579
But that was before you guys
had an argument, wasn't it?

15:13.579 --> 15:18.346
But I still have faith in them!
I have faith in Zero and Ichii!

15:19.485 --> 15:20.953
Interesting!

15:20.953 --> 15:23.489
If you insist that much, let's test it.

15:23.489 --> 15:25.724
Let's test the degree of trust
between you three.

15:25.724 --> 15:28.887
Will, what are you talking about?
That wasn't in our plan-

15:30.229 --> 15:31.787
Wh-What is it?

15:35.267 --> 15:37.428
Now I don't hear anything.

15:42.007 --> 15:46.345
My voice... My voice is gone!

15:46.345 --> 15:51.942
Now I want you to show me
how much you guys trust each other!

15:55.120 --> 16:01.787
Zero, Ichii, Nina-chan is
calling for you. Come to me.

16:05.564 --> 16:08.067
Let's go where Nina-chan is!

16:08.067 --> 16:09.601
- Even if this is a trap,
- Even if this is a trap,

16:09.601 --> 16:11.737
- if she is needing us!
- if she is needing us!

16:11.737 --> 16:13.295
- Even if this is a trap...
- Even if this is a trap...

16:16.108 --> 16:17.541
Are you all right, Nina?

16:20.913 --> 16:22.614
Nina?

16:22.614 --> 16:24.717
She can't talk.

16:24.717 --> 16:25.718
Why?

16:25.718 --> 16:27.853
She made a pact with me.

16:27.853 --> 16:31.323
That is to let you pass the test
in exchange for her voice.

16:31.323 --> 16:32.624
What?

16:32.624 --> 16:36.492
That's how it is, so I will
give Nina-chan back to you. Go.

16:38.464 --> 16:43.569
What? Nina, what are you saying, Nina?
I don't understand!

16:43.569 --> 16:48.173
That's not true, Zero, Ichii!
I've never made a pact like that!

16:48.173 --> 16:51.844
You see, you two were struggling
with the dragon earlier, remember?

16:51.844 --> 16:56.048
So Nina-chan begged me, saying,
"There's no way they can win against it,

16:56.048 --> 16:59.985
so please let them pass the test
in exchange for my voice!"

16:59.985 --> 17:03.222
That's not true! I believed
in both of you, Zero and Ichii!

17:03.222 --> 17:05.290
What a sweet girl she is.

17:05.290 --> 17:08.927
Thanks to her you two have
passed the test. Good for you.

17:08.927 --> 17:12.531
That's not true! That's not true!
I believed in both of you!

17:12.531 --> 17:13.932
Please believe me!

17:13.932 --> 17:15.167
Damn it!

17:15.167 --> 17:17.069
It's not good at all!

17:17.069 --> 17:20.572
We've already decided that
we would protect Nina till the end!

17:20.572 --> 17:24.576
Even if we passed the test,
if Nina-chan isn't safe, it's pointless!

17:24.576 --> 17:28.480
Shit! I can't believe you made Nina cry!
I will never forgive you for that!

17:28.480 --> 17:30.749
Why don't you give her voice back?

17:30.749 --> 17:32.618
Come on, take it easy.

17:32.618 --> 17:37.256
You still have plenty of time
until sunset, which is the time limit.

17:37.256 --> 17:40.225
Therefore I shall give you an option.

17:40.225 --> 17:42.428
An option?

17:42.428 --> 17:44.196
This is her voice.

17:44.196 --> 17:48.000
If you wish, I wouldn't mind
giving this back to you right now.

17:48.000 --> 17:52.237
But you must drop out
of the sorcery test in return.

17:52.237 --> 17:56.264
Now answer me! Will you
take the test or Nina?

17:57.576 --> 17:58.644
- That's-
- That's-

17:58.644 --> 17:59.945
That's what?

17:59.945 --> 18:01.780
What are you going to do?

18:01.780 --> 18:03.315
Give me your answer!

18:03.315 --> 18:07.753
Are you going to take the test
or Nina? Which one is it?

18:07.753 --> 18:10.389
Geez, what a ridiculous question!

18:10.389 --> 18:13.759
Which one would we choose?
Isn't it obvious?

18:13.759 --> 18:16.523
That's right. There's nothing
for us to choose!

18:17.629 --> 18:18.764
Because the answer is-

18:18.764 --> 18:20.163
- Both!
- Both!

18:21.600 --> 18:23.068
Both?

18:23.068 --> 18:24.970
That's right, both!

18:24.970 --> 18:26.238
Let's go, Zero!

18:26.238 --> 18:28.440
Yeah, I'm all ready!

18:28.440 --> 18:30.209
Destruction magic!

18:30.209 --> 18:31.471
Defense magic!

18:32.711 --> 18:34.680
Magic Cannon!

18:34.680 --> 18:36.671
Doppler Capsule!

18:38.217 --> 18:39.184
I see.

18:39.184 --> 18:42.087
You must be planning to defeat me
then obtain her voice.

18:42.087 --> 18:44.749
I guess that could be an option, too.

18:45.991 --> 18:47.390
However!

18:50.129 --> 18:51.530
You're too naive!

18:51.530 --> 18:52.464
What?

18:52.464 --> 18:55.134
We're not done yet! Destruction magic!

18:55.134 --> 18:56.726
Defense magic!

19:06.345 --> 19:08.347
This guy is really strong!

19:08.347 --> 19:09.815
Of course I am!

19:09.815 --> 19:11.817
After all you're just amateurs.

19:11.817 --> 19:14.119
You'll never win against me, a pro!

19:14.119 --> 19:15.187
What do we do?

19:15.187 --> 19:17.623
Zero, use your techniques on me!

19:17.623 --> 19:19.658
Ichii? What are you talking about?

19:19.658 --> 19:24.263
It'll be fine! I've got an idea.
I'll make it work.

19:24.263 --> 19:26.298
- But-
- It'll be fine!

19:26.298 --> 19:27.766
Just trust me!

19:27.766 --> 19:31.103
Ichii... It's not my problem
if you regret it later, all right?

19:31.103 --> 19:32.104
Yeah.

19:32.104 --> 19:34.540
I'll give it all I've got!

19:34.540 --> 19:35.666
Come on!

19:51.723 --> 19:53.953
Destruction magic!

20:02.201 --> 20:05.204
Magic Cannon!

20:05.204 --> 20:06.805
Take that!

20:06.805 --> 20:08.907
Ichii!

20:08.907 --> 20:12.811
This is insane!
He's attacking his own partner?

20:12.811 --> 20:15.075
Inspector. You fell for it.

20:16.448 --> 20:17.583
What the...

20:17.583 --> 20:20.953
This isn't Zero's attack against me.

20:20.953 --> 20:25.390
This is more like his passion
called trust that he has for me!

20:28.160 --> 20:30.429
Oh, I get it!

20:30.429 --> 20:32.864
They must've sucked the
Magic Cannon attack into the capsule,

20:32.864 --> 20:35.834
and concentrated its force
into a given space!

20:35.834 --> 20:41.670
You two... Zero and Ichii must
understand each other that much!

20:50.249 --> 20:52.809
I've got it! It's your voice!

20:54.820 --> 20:56.355
What an idiot...

20:56.355 --> 21:00.626
Yeah, that was their "strategy,"
but to think he'd attack his own ally...

21:00.626 --> 21:03.829
Those two... Zero and Ichii...

21:03.829 --> 21:06.531
Here, swallow that, Nina.

21:06.531 --> 21:08.300
How's that?

21:08.300 --> 21:10.602
I... I...

21:10.602 --> 21:12.604
Nina! You voice is back!

21:12.604 --> 21:13.672
I...

21:13.672 --> 21:15.907
I'm glad, Nina-chan!

21:15.907 --> 21:19.845
I had faith in you, Zero and Ichii...

21:19.845 --> 21:22.848
No matter what happened,
I knew that you would come for me!

21:22.848 --> 21:25.951
I did... Zero! Ichii!

21:25.951 --> 21:27.486
You silly...

21:27.486 --> 21:30.856
We're glad to know
that you have faith in us.

21:30.856 --> 21:34.159
Zero, Ichii! You guys are the best!

21:34.159 --> 21:35.327
You're the best!

21:35.327 --> 21:39.031
- Nina.
- Nina-chan.
- Best indeed.

21:39.031 --> 21:40.932
I understand that was your strategy,

21:40.932 --> 21:45.604
but you two were the biggest idiots
for attacking your own ally.

21:45.604 --> 21:48.307
But that was the result of the trust
that you share with each other.

21:48.307 --> 21:49.908
It wouldn't have been possible

21:49.908 --> 21:52.944
if it weren't for the fact you two trust
each other's power and the heart.

21:52.944 --> 21:56.515
You have now passed
the test, Zero, Ichii.

21:56.515 --> 22:00.552
I've never seen magic like that before.

22:00.552 --> 22:04.056
I approve that your magic is good enough
to go up against the magic used by pros.

22:04.056 --> 22:05.090
Will!

22:05.090 --> 22:06.258
Inspector!

22:06.258 --> 22:08.960
Therefore you two have passed the test.

22:08.960 --> 22:11.129
And also I'd like to
make a special exception!

22:11.129 --> 22:13.598
I shall let all your friends
pass the test as well!

22:13.598 --> 22:17.436
- Because your friends just won't give up!
- Lady Rokka, the test is over.

22:17.436 --> 22:19.604
- I've already told them
that they failed the test,
- Let's just get out of here.

22:19.604 --> 22:21.973
- but they're still hanging in there
- No! No matter what happens, I will!

22:21.973 --> 22:24.009
- for the dream to become sorcerers!
- I'm going to take
the test with Ichii-sama!

22:24.009 --> 22:25.344
At least try to defend
your dream on your own!

22:25.344 --> 22:26.545
This isn't good enough to convince me!

22:26.545 --> 22:29.281
Just like you two,

22:29.281 --> 22:32.951
your friends would not stop climbing up
even if they were deep under the ground!

22:32.951 --> 22:35.454
Because they want to defend
their own dreams at least!

22:35.454 --> 22:38.490
Because they want to support
their partner's dreams at least!

22:38.490 --> 22:41.893
They trust each other just like you two.

22:41.893 --> 22:44.363
So why not let them pass the test, right?

22:44.363 --> 22:48.333
It's a waste to fail these
interesting friends of yours anyway!

22:48.333 --> 22:50.102
Besides it feels like
they're going to do something

22:50.102 --> 22:53.003
even more entertaining
at the sorcery test!

22:55.374 --> 22:57.909
So everyone's qualified!

22:57.909 --> 22:59.672
All of you have
wonderfully passed the test!

23:00.512 --> 23:02.114
Well, there you have it!

23:02.114 --> 23:03.103
Adieu!

23:04.516 --> 23:07.586
- Will!
- Hey, did we pass the test?

23:07.586 --> 23:08.920
Yeah.

23:08.920 --> 23:13.125
We did it! Now we can remain
in the human world where Ichii-sama is!

23:13.125 --> 23:14.393
Well, Nina-chan!

23:14.393 --> 23:15.327
Huh?

23:15.327 --> 23:17.295
I ask for your continued
good will in the future!

23:17.295 --> 23:18.330
- Me, too!
- Me, too!
- Me, too!

23:18.330 --> 23:22.768
So that means I'll continue
to be chased down by you guys?

23:22.768 --> 23:23.869
- That's correct!
- That's correct!
- That's correct!

23:23.869 --> 23:24.970
- That's correct!
- That's correct!
- That's correct!

23:24.970 --> 23:26.238
- That's correct!
- That's correct!
- That's correct!

23:26.238 --> 23:30.641
What? No!! I don't want
to live like this!

23:34.279 --> 23:38.272
But I think I'd be sad to be
apart from Zero and Ichii.

23:44.322 --> 23:47.259
Pit-a-pat, skip! Parallel pop!

23:47.259 --> 23:50.162
Pit-a-pat, step! Miracle kiss!

23:50.162 --> 23:53.154
Pit-a-pat, magical! Lollipop!

24:01.973 --> 24:07.679
My heart is beating so fast.
He might notice.

24:07.679 --> 24:13.552
My heart is pounding and throbbing.
It feels like it's going to burst.

24:13.552 --> 24:19.391
No matter which direction I look,
his eyes are crystals.

24:19.391 --> 24:25.297
They are so brilliant
that I just look away.

24:25.297 --> 24:31.136
The seed of love has begun to sprout.
Even my magic, too! Check it out!

24:31.136 --> 24:39.478
They will keep on growing
and spinning and explode!

24:39.478 --> 24:45.283
Popping lollipop. Save me, lollipop!
Throbbing heart.

24:45.283 --> 24:51.590
Two candies, I can't decide
which one is better.

24:51.590 --> 24:57.462
Even the earth turns the other way,
if you hold me,

24:57.462 --> 25:03.368
the shape of my heart will change
just like pit-a-pat!

25:03.368 --> 25:08.965
The shape of my heart will change
just like pit-a-pat! Lollipop!

25:12.944 --> 25:15.680
Nina-chan, what kind of event is this?

25:15.680 --> 25:18.116
I will curse you...

25:18.116 --> 25:19.284
It's an event to test your courage!

25:19.284 --> 25:21.353
The rumor has it that if you
confess your love to the person that

25:21.353 --> 25:23.388
you're paired up with, the relationship
will definitely be successful!

25:23.388 --> 25:25.824
I will curse you...

25:25.824 --> 25:27.926
I see... Hey, what the hell are you?

25:27.926 --> 25:29.761
We are ghosts!

25:29.761 --> 25:32.430
I'll scare you so much
that you'll wet your pants!

25:32.430 --> 25:36.001
Next time on Save Me! Lollipop,
"The Summer Event is Super Stimulating!"

25:36.001 --> 25:37.798
Get scared! Get scared!
